.TH gitaway-profile-default 1  "gitaway 0.0.0" "gitaway manual"
.SH NAME
gitaway\-profile\-default \- Make a profile the default, used when nothing more specific applies
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgitaway profile default\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Make a profile the default, used when nothing more specific applies
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
The profile to make the default
